# M15 "Avlaklar", flow "m15_slots" run esik (Ortaocak, EnterLevel = 20, MonsterAttack = 25: the server's
# testing hooks, docs/PROTOCOL_LEVELS.md §5): a new Aydor warrior enters Ortaocak at level 20, leaves its
# 57 points unspent and hunts the three new slot kinds of the neutral land: İs Korusu 2 (İs Avcısı, levels
# 11-13, west), Döküm Taşlığı 3 (Cüruf Zırhlısı, 14-16, south-west) and Kor Halkası 3 (Kor Büyücüsü,
# 17-19, south-east). At each: the slot's name line (approach), the fight, the kill.
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m15_esik
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Ocakavcisi
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+statsknown 1800
waitfor world+ready+nobanner 600
expect world+level20+unspent57+safezone
# ---- İs Korusu 2: İs Avcısı (11-13) ----
scene walkpath 117.9 317.7
waitfor world+nodest+standing 3600
waitfor world+monsters 600
expect world+slot+slot_esik_is_2
expecttext world.slotname İs Korusu 2 · Sv. 11-13
scene walktomonster İs Avcısı 8
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene camera behind 20 7
wait 4
screenshot 13_is_approach.png
scene target nearest İs Avcısı
key f
waitfor world+attacking+ownhits1 900
scene camera side 24 6
wait 6
screenshot 14_is_fight.png
waitfor world+kills1 2400
expect world+alive
wait 40
scene camera side 28 6
wait 5
screenshot 15_is_kill.png
# ---- Döküm Taşlığı 3: Cüruf Zırhlısı (14-16) ----
key escape
scene walkpath 101.3 166.5
waitfor world+nodest+standing 4800
waitfor world+alive 600
expect world+slot+slot_esik_dokum_3
expecttext world.slotname Döküm Taşlığı 3 · Sv. 14-16
scene walktomonster Cüruf Zırhlısı 8
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene camera behind 20 7
wait 4
screenshot 16_dokum_approach.png
scene target nearest Cüruf Zırhlısı
key f
waitfor world+attacking+incombat 900
wait 30
scene camera side 26 7
wait 6
screenshot 17_dokum_fight.png
waitfor world+kills2 3600
expect world+alive
wait 40
scene camera side 30 7
wait 5
screenshot 18_dokum_kill.png
# ---- Kor Halkası 3: Kor Büyücüsü (17-19) ----
key escape
scene walkpath 358.9 99.9
waitfor world+nodest+standing 6000
waitfor world+alive 600
expect world+slot+slot_esik_kor_3
expecttext world.slotname Kor Halkası 3 · Sv. 17-19
scene walktomonster Kor Büyücüsü 8
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene camera behind 20 7
wait 4
screenshot 19_kor_approach.png
scene target nearest Kor Büyücüsü
key f
waitfor world+attacking+incombat 900
wait 30
scene camera side 26 7
wait 6
screenshot 20_kor_fight.png
waitfor world+kills3 3600
expect world+alive
wait 40
scene camera side 30 7
wait 5
screenshot 21_kor_kill.png
quit
